window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Step into a world where the boundaries between life, death, and the afterlife blur in <i>\"Quantum Resurrection.\"</i> Detective Jack Spec is thrust into a transformative journey after a fatal attack leaves him and his family in a morgue over Christmas. His soul, trapped in a limbo state, encounters both God and the Devil, who reveal a cosmic glitch that leaves his fate undecided. Now, Jack must return to Earth, balancing between life and the unknown, as he unravels a web of corruption, spiritual mysteries, and political interference.</p> <p>Guided by God’s cryptic words, Jack’s faith and sanity are questioned by his peers. Amidst this spiritual and metaphysical chaos, he uncovers an alien life form seeking solutions to Earth’s destruction—paralleling the downfall of its own world. As Jack navigates between mysticism and reality, quantum theology, and paranormal events, his journey becomes one of survival and revelation. Can he restore balance to his life, the world, and the afterlife before it’s too late?</p> <p>This speculative fiction tale fuses <i>Mysticism &amp; Christianity, Religion of Spiritualism,</i> and <i>Quantum Theology,</i> blending elements of <i>Urban Fantasy, Mystery, and the Paranormal</i> to explore the complexities of existence. Perfect for fans of spiritual thrillers with a sci-fi twist.</p>"; 
